    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d485">

                <pb facs="0669" n="575" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg575"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Manion to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Johannesburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-02-07"><hi rendition="#italic">February 7,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hammond out on bail, but under guard. Government continues to show wisdom and
                    magnanimity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manion.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
